1
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:14,347
This is Ranma from

2
00:00:14,431 --> 00:00:17,267
the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts.

3
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:22,480
Our dear Ranma here has
a bit of a problem.

4
00:00:26,526 --> 00:00:29,654
He transforms into a girl
when splashed with cold water.

5
00:00:35,285 --> 00:00:39,539
RANMA1/2

6
00:02:01,579 --> 00:02:03,206
HOT COMPETITION

7
00:02:03,289 --> 00:02:05,416
Attacking
with your bare hands is forbidden

8
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:07,460
in Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics.

9
00:02:08,086 --> 00:02:09,254
The match is tomorrow.

10
00:02:09,754 --> 00:02:13,299
The only way for you
to master every technique is practice.

11
00:02:13,383 --> 00:02:14,884
Hmm.

12
00:02:14,968 --> 00:02:16,177
Have you prepared yourself?

13
00:02:16,261 --> 00:02:19,931
The real question is
are you ready for this?

14
00:02:20,014 --> 00:02:21,516
I want you to come at me from any dir--

15
00:02:24,769 --> 00:02:26,396
Ha! Too eas--

16
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:28,064
What are you, an animal?

17
00:02:28,148 --> 00:02:29,691
Use the tools I gave you.

18
00:02:30,316 --> 00:02:31,317
Huh.

19
00:02:31,401 --> 00:02:33,027
Yeah, you're really annoying.

20
00:02:34,154 --> 00:02:36,447
Okay, let's try this again!

21
00:02:45,832 --> 00:02:47,458
Hmm? Hmm.

22
00:02:50,628 --> 00:02:53,047
Oh.

23
00:03:03,057 --> 00:03:04,726
WORM - DOG

24
00:03:04,809 --> 00:03:06,477
TWERP - LOSER

25
00:03:07,061 --> 00:03:09,856
Wow. You're pretty good at this, Ranma.

26
00:03:09,939 --> 00:03:11,399
I know.

27
00:03:11,983 --> 00:03:14,110
I wasn't just hanging out
when I spent the whole week with you--

28
00:03:17,822 --> 00:03:19,574
What the heck!

29
00:03:19,657 --> 00:03:21,409
Ranma, are you okay?

30
00:03:21,492 --> 00:03:22,952
Lay down and get some rest.

31
00:03:23,036 --> 00:03:24,537
I can't just go and take a nap.

32
00:03:24,621 --> 00:03:27,457
Why? You're not getting worried
about me, are you?

33
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:29,250
As if. You know that's not what I meant.

34
00:03:31,419 --> 00:03:33,796
Please rest. And, no,
you don't have to worry.

35
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:36,925
I'll be making sure
he learns my secret techniques properly.

36
00:03:37,008 --> 00:03:39,010
Really?

37
00:03:40,803 --> 00:03:44,140
Well, if he keeps going at this
pace he'll win without breaking a sweat.

38
00:03:45,183 --> 00:03:46,184
Hold on.

39
00:03:46,935 --> 00:03:48,561
Where did P-chan run off to?

40
00:03:50,521 --> 00:03:53,191
I happened
to hear something earlier.

41
00:03:53,274 --> 00:03:54,776
If you lose the match tomorrow,

42
00:03:55,652 --> 00:03:58,446
then you have implicitly agreed
to give yourself over

43
00:03:58,529 --> 00:04:00,698
to Kodachi, the Black Rose, as her prize.

44
00:04:01,241 --> 00:04:02,242
Yeah.

45
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:07,664
In other words, you'll be forced into
breaking off your relationship with Akane.

46
00:04:08,331 --> 00:04:10,917
So I expect you
to do what you can to lose, Ranma!

47
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:15,463
Hmph. I did think it was strange
you were so interested in coaching me.

48
00:04:15,546 --> 00:04:17,340
I knew you weren't just doing it
to be nice.

49
00:04:17,423 --> 00:04:21,552
Sorry to tell you this, but I have
no intention of dating that woman.

50
00:04:24,514 --> 00:04:26,891
Good luck standing
when your legs are broken.

51
00:04:26,975 --> 00:04:30,311
Go ahead. I'd like to see you try!

52
00:04:52,625 --> 00:04:55,795
I slept so well.

53
00:04:56,296 --> 00:04:58,006
And the weather's perfect.

54
00:04:58,089 --> 00:05:00,675
Mmm.

55
00:05:00,758 --> 00:05:01,759
Uh...

56
00:05:06,556 --> 00:05:08,474
What's going on? What are you doing?

57
00:05:09,892 --> 00:05:12,061
There! Had enough?

58
00:05:12,145 --> 00:05:14,647
I'm not done yet.

59
00:05:14,731 --> 00:05:17,108
Wha... Have you two been at it
all night long?

60
00:05:17,734 --> 00:05:20,695
It's morning already?

61
00:05:23,573 --> 00:05:26,284
Hey, uh, are you doing okay?

62
00:05:28,745 --> 00:05:31,414
I'm fine, just fine.

63
00:05:31,497 --> 00:05:35,335
I'm doing so good.

64
00:05:35,835 --> 00:05:37,128
- Kasumi.
- Hmm?

65
00:05:39,005 --> 00:05:41,007
This fish cake's very tough.

66
00:05:41,090 --> 00:05:43,968
- 'Cause that's a towel, dear.
- Oh, okay.

67
00:05:44,052 --> 00:05:45,511
H-He's out of it.

68
00:05:49,390 --> 00:05:51,476
Pardon the interruption. There will be

69
00:05:51,559 --> 00:05:56,147
a Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics
match held later today at 1:00 p.m...

70
00:05:56,230 --> 00:05:57,690
You want to play your substitution?

71
00:05:57,774 --> 00:06:00,109
Yes. I got injured yesterday.

72
00:06:00,193 --> 00:06:02,653
She'll be the one taking my place.

73
00:06:02,737 --> 00:06:04,739
Oh, yes. The girl with the pigtail.

74
00:06:05,239 --> 00:06:07,116
I believe she and I have met before.

75
00:06:07,742 --> 00:06:08,993
Very well, then.

76
00:06:09,952 --> 00:06:12,163
To a good match,
and may the best woman win.

77
00:06:12,246 --> 00:06:13,331
Mm-hmm.

78
00:06:14,707 --> 00:06:17,877
Oh! Now how did
all those little tacks get there?

79
00:06:18,878 --> 00:06:20,713
FURINKAN HIGH SCHOOL

80
00:06:20,797 --> 00:06:21,798
This is the place.

81
00:06:24,717 --> 00:06:26,219
Look out!

82
00:06:30,556 --> 00:06:32,600
You can't let your guard down
for a second.

83
00:06:34,685 --> 00:06:38,147
I'm awake now.

84
00:06:38,231 --> 00:06:40,608
Mmm? Huh?

85
00:06:40,691 --> 00:06:42,860
GOOD LUCK
FROM THE BLACK ROSE

86
00:06:43,736 --> 00:06:44,946
Hmm?

87
00:06:52,328 --> 00:06:53,913
Must be sleeping pills.

88
00:06:58,793 --> 00:07:01,295
This is St. Bacchus' School
for Girls, right?

89
00:07:01,379 --> 00:07:03,172
Please tell me this is the place.

90
00:07:03,256 --> 00:07:04,590
Uh, yeah.

91
00:07:04,674 --> 00:07:07,885
I can't believe I got here
without getting lost.

92
00:07:07,969 --> 00:07:09,971
- What is that guy's problem?
- Mm-mmm.

93
00:07:10,054 --> 00:07:15,101
I never had a sense of direction before,
but I made it all the way here in one go!

94
00:07:15,977 --> 00:07:19,188
That proves
the power of love. Akane!

95
00:07:21,941 --> 00:07:24,527
Now isn't the time
for me to stand around and cry.

96
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:26,988
I came here because I wanted
to mess up Ranma's fight--

97
00:07:28,406 --> 00:07:30,908
Watch it! What if there was
a person down there?

98
00:07:31,409 --> 00:07:33,619
It's okay. It's just a little piggy.

99
00:07:38,124 --> 00:07:41,294
I've done what I can,
but I still need to land the final blow.

100
00:07:41,878 --> 00:07:44,630
I have to secure the win
so I may date Lord Ranma.

101
00:07:44,714 --> 00:07:46,674
Hmm?

102
00:07:48,676 --> 00:07:50,261
- You're so cute!
- Oh!

103
00:07:50,344 --> 00:07:52,013
Oh! I wanna hold it next.

104
00:07:52,096 --> 00:07:54,307
Where do you guys think
this piggy came from?

105
00:07:55,433 --> 00:07:57,393
- Oh! Kodachi.
- Huh?

106
00:07:58,436 --> 00:08:01,147
Perhaps I know of a way
for this little piggy to be of use.

107
00:08:06,402 --> 00:08:08,321
Thank you
to the ten million fans

108
00:08:08,404 --> 00:08:11,032
that have tuned in
to this broadcast nationwide!

109
00:08:11,115 --> 00:08:13,367
The Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics match

110
00:08:13,451 --> 00:08:16,496
between Furinkan High School
and St. Bacchus' School for Girls

111
00:08:16,579 --> 00:08:18,498
will be kicking off at any moment.

112
00:08:19,457 --> 00:08:22,084
Now we ask that you turn your eyes
to the entrance.

113
00:08:22,668 --> 00:08:24,754
The school representatives are coming in!

114
00:08:25,338 --> 00:08:28,424
Kodachi, the Black Rose,
is the first to enter the spotlight.

115
00:08:28,508 --> 00:08:30,927
A halo of light surrounds her frame
like a goddess.

116
00:08:31,928 --> 00:08:34,263
Furinkan High School is heading
toward the other corner.

117
00:08:34,347 --> 00:08:37,391
Furinkan's player was injured
and requested a last-second replacement,

118
00:08:37,475 --> 00:08:39,101
so the school will be represented

119
00:08:39,185 --> 00:08:42,230
by the beautiful and mysterious woman
coming into the ring.

120
00:08:42,313 --> 00:08:44,941
We can hear the crowd's excitement
swelling into a boil

121
00:08:45,024 --> 00:08:46,817
as they begin to chant Kodachi's name.

122
00:08:47,652 --> 00:08:49,946
The mystery girl shows
incredible concentration,

123
00:08:50,029 --> 00:08:51,614
even while competing away from home.

124
00:08:51,697 --> 00:08:54,867
I am really looking forward to this one!

125
00:08:54,951 --> 00:08:57,995
Kodachi! Kodachi!

126
00:08:58,079 --> 00:08:59,455
Hello, elder brother.

127
00:08:59,539 --> 00:09:01,123
Ah. Hello there.

128
00:09:01,207 --> 00:09:03,501
- It's Kodachi's brother!
- He's hot!

129
00:09:03,584 --> 00:09:04,544
And so cool.

130
00:09:04,627 --> 00:09:07,922
Is he, though? Well,
I guess it's better if I don't get it.

131
00:09:08,005 --> 00:09:09,257
You got that right.

132
00:09:11,842 --> 00:09:13,719
In the Red Corner...

133
00:09:15,596 --> 00:09:18,975
Kodachi Kuno!

134
00:09:21,435 --> 00:09:23,020
Blue Corner...

135
00:09:24,438 --> 00:09:26,816
Oh, oh, sorry. What's your name again?

136
00:09:26,899 --> 00:09:28,192
Ranma Saotome.

137
00:09:29,068 --> 00:09:30,820
You're giving them your real name?

138
00:09:30,903 --> 00:09:32,572
Oh, it'll be fine.

139
00:09:33,990 --> 00:09:36,325
Representing
Furinkan High School...

140
00:09:40,955 --> 00:09:43,874
...Ranma Saotome!

141
00:09:44,792 --> 00:09:46,210
Ranma Saotome?

142
00:09:46,294 --> 00:09:48,588
Uh, wait. It's the pigtailed girl.

143
00:09:48,671 --> 00:09:51,299
- Her name is Ranma Saotome?
- Ranma?

144
00:09:51,382 --> 00:09:53,593
- Well do they have the same name?
- That's weird, right?

145
00:09:56,971 --> 00:10:00,141
That girl's name
is Ranma Saotome, is it?

146
00:10:00,224 --> 00:10:03,102
So she would dare to have
the same name as my lord?

147
00:10:03,185 --> 00:10:05,688
That's really, really, really annoying.

148
00:10:06,272 --> 00:10:07,732
At last I know her true name!

149
00:10:07,815 --> 00:10:10,192
I'd better write it down
so as not to forget.

150
00:10:10,276 --> 00:10:14,238
Well, all right, then.
They just have the same name.

151
00:10:14,864 --> 00:10:17,825
I mean, that might be it.
But she kinda looks like him.

152
00:10:18,326 --> 00:10:20,453
Lots of people look similar
to each other, man.

153
00:10:21,078 --> 00:10:22,705
See?

154
00:10:23,623 --> 00:10:27,001
Fighters, come to the center.

155
00:10:27,752 --> 00:10:29,587
Okay! Please shake hands
when you're ready.

156
00:10:33,382 --> 00:10:35,301
- What's that over there?
- Huh?

157
00:10:35,384 --> 00:10:36,802
Uh...

158
00:10:36,886 --> 00:10:38,054
- Huh?
- Hmm.

159
00:10:38,137 --> 00:10:40,097
It was a mistake
to let your guard down.

160
00:10:43,726 --> 00:10:45,436
Hmm.

161
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:47,438
P-chan?

162
00:10:49,857 --> 00:10:52,318
What is it with you
always getting in the way?

163
00:10:57,239 --> 00:10:59,950
You're gonna pay, Ryoga.

164
00:11:03,329 --> 00:11:05,748
The ring of the bell has
already been drowned out

165
00:11:05,831 --> 00:11:07,917
by the deafening roars of this crowd.

166
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:11,671
This single-round, no-holds-barred match
has now begun.

167
00:11:11,754 --> 00:11:13,172
Bringing you live commentary,

168
00:11:13,255 --> 00:11:14,757
you know and love the team,

169
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:18,177
it's Ichiro and the
Furinkan High School Radio Club.

170
00:11:19,053 --> 00:11:20,388
Furinkan?

171
00:11:20,471 --> 00:11:22,223
Is it just me, or are they everywhere?

172
00:11:22,765 --> 00:11:25,434
The contenders are not allowed
to strike with bare hands.

173
00:11:25,518 --> 00:11:28,854
It will end only when
one of them is knocked down for good.

174
00:11:28,938 --> 00:11:29,897
The rules also state

175
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:33,275
that falling out of the ring
results in immediate disqualification.

176
00:11:33,359 --> 00:11:36,320
All right, Ryoga. Cause me trouble
and I'm eating ham tonight.

177
00:11:37,321 --> 00:11:39,949
Can't really say
I'm a big fan of hitting girls.

178
00:11:40,032 --> 00:11:43,494
I'll push you out of the ring
before I even need to hit you!

179
00:11:46,622 --> 00:11:48,541
How charming of you to be so considerate.

180
00:11:48,624 --> 00:11:50,334
Fantastic rope-handling!

181
00:11:50,418 --> 00:11:53,921
We should expect nothing less
from the sport's flower, Kodachi Kuno!

182
00:11:54,004 --> 00:11:55,172
Uh...

183
00:11:57,633 --> 00:12:00,177
Hang on. What is that? A pole?

184
00:12:00,261 --> 00:12:02,054
It's a pole that looks like a rope!

185
00:12:02,138 --> 00:12:04,140
Come on, ref! Those aren't legal.

186
00:12:04,223 --> 00:12:06,142
They are. Using tools is safe.

187
00:12:06,225 --> 00:12:07,685
Huh?

188
00:12:07,768 --> 00:12:09,645
Kodachi's switching
to the club now.

189
00:12:10,312 --> 00:12:12,815
She's throwing out a barrage of strikes!

190
00:12:13,941 --> 00:12:16,318
Wait! Did she put spikes
all over the end of that club?

191
00:12:18,195 --> 00:12:19,780
I'm not seeing anything on 'em.

192
00:12:20,656 --> 00:12:24,076
Did she get custom-made clubs
with a built-in button for spikes?

193
00:12:24,785 --> 00:12:27,788
She may be my sister,
but that is brilliantly sneaky.

194
00:12:27,872 --> 00:12:31,584
I do it all in the pursuit
of dating Lord Ranma Saotome.

195
00:12:32,710 --> 00:12:35,796
Yes, I'm an unbelievably tragic
and brave heroine.

196
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:37,339
Don't be ridiculous!

197
00:12:37,423 --> 00:12:40,259
That's funny. So, I'm curious.
When do I get a say in this?

198
00:12:40,342 --> 00:12:43,220
'Cause I don't wanna date you!

199
00:12:45,222 --> 00:12:46,891
- Pig. Legal!
- Pig. Legal!

200
00:12:46,974 --> 00:12:50,144
Ranma Saotome executes
a perfect pig attack!

201
00:12:50,936 --> 00:12:52,730
Its use as a tool has been approved.

202
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:57,526
Who said anything about dating you?
What a fool.

203
00:12:57,610 --> 00:12:58,944
Yeah, whatever.

204
00:12:59,028 --> 00:13:03,157
If you lose, you need to stop bugging
both the Ranma Saotomes. Hear me?

205
00:13:03,657 --> 00:13:04,825
Hmm?

206
00:13:05,534 --> 00:13:08,829
And who exactly are you
when it comes to our Lord Ranma?

207
00:13:08,913 --> 00:13:11,248
Are you leaving us alone or not? Huh?

208
00:13:13,167 --> 00:13:14,335
Wh-What are you doing?

209
00:13:14,418 --> 00:13:17,588
So you must be in love
with Lord Ranma as well.

210
00:13:17,671 --> 00:13:20,090
Is that why you're determined
to keep getting in the way?

211
00:13:20,174 --> 00:13:21,801
Now what kind of woman are you?

212
00:13:21,884 --> 00:13:23,844
Good luck dodging any of this!

213
00:13:25,054 --> 00:13:27,056
He already said he doesn't like you.

214
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:30,267
I shall soon be exposing that lie.

215
00:13:30,893 --> 00:13:32,353
- Hoop, now.
- Here!

216
00:13:33,103 --> 00:13:35,981
An insolent woman does not deserve
to say my lord's name.

217
00:13:36,065 --> 00:13:38,734
Fall back and accept your judgment
from the Black Rose!

218
00:13:38,818 --> 00:13:40,861
The hoop is in the air!

219
00:13:40,945 --> 00:13:42,363
Is that a razor?

220
00:13:45,449 --> 00:13:48,285
Well done!
She narrowly avoided a ribbon strike.

221
00:13:50,788 --> 00:13:52,832
But our goddess of war isn't done yet.

222
00:13:53,541 --> 00:13:57,962
Ranma dodges it like an expert with a stag
jump stacked on top of an open leg jump.

223
00:13:58,045 --> 00:13:59,213
Fantastic defense!

224
00:13:59,296 --> 00:14:01,131
Ranma!

225
00:14:02,132 --> 00:14:04,301
If you're not gonna get it
the first time I say it,

226
00:14:04,885 --> 00:14:07,137
I'm just gonna have
to make you understand!

227
00:14:07,221 --> 00:14:08,347
Amazing!

228
00:14:08,430 --> 00:14:10,641
She turned her pole into nunchucks!

229
00:14:10,724 --> 00:14:12,768
Hmm. This is so absurd.

230
00:14:13,310 --> 00:14:14,728
You've given me no choice

231
00:14:14,812 --> 00:14:17,106
but to utilise
the Black Rose's secret move.

232
00:14:17,606 --> 00:14:21,277
Feel my Attack of One Thousand Hand Clubs!

233
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:24,280
Oh, no! Then her Thousand Arms
seem to have manifested before us

234
00:14:24,363 --> 00:14:25,739
in the center of the ring!

235
00:14:25,823 --> 00:14:28,033
I believe I can make out
at least ten or 20 clubs.

236
00:14:28,117 --> 00:14:29,034
Ranma!

237
00:14:31,078 --> 00:14:33,205
Attack!

238
00:14:37,626 --> 00:14:39,128
Whoa!

239
00:14:40,087 --> 00:14:41,797
Upon further inspection,...

240
00:14:41,881 --> 00:14:44,967
...it appears that Kodachi Kuno was
only able to utilise that move

241
00:14:45,050 --> 00:14:46,552
by using ten to 20 clubs!

242
00:14:46,635 --> 00:14:48,137
That is beyond super sneaky!

243
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:49,138
Keep watching.

244
00:14:49,221 --> 00:14:52,057
The essence of
Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics

245
00:14:52,141 --> 00:14:54,184
is evolving our use of tools!

246
00:14:54,268 --> 00:14:55,603
Huh?

247
00:14:57,021 --> 00:14:58,731
Hmph.

248
00:15:00,316 --> 00:15:03,319
- A deadly attack with the bell!
- Uh-oh!

249
00:15:03,402 --> 00:15:05,946
Ranma Saotome blocks it with the pig!

250
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:08,115
That piggy is squealing right now.

251
00:15:08,198 --> 00:15:11,118
He's probably telling our contender
that she's lost her mind!

252
00:15:11,744 --> 00:15:14,204
Uh, what else was I supposed to do?

253
00:15:14,705 --> 00:15:16,290
- Now's my chance!
- Oh, crap!

254
00:15:16,373 --> 00:15:17,833
It's my turn.

255
00:15:20,127 --> 00:15:23,047
Ranma's grabbed the announcer's table!

256
00:15:23,130 --> 00:15:26,592
Like the Tosa fishers of old,
she cast a single line to snatch our table

257
00:15:26,675 --> 00:15:28,385
and make it dance through the air!

258
00:15:32,264 --> 00:15:35,559
Undaunted, Kodachi wraps up
and reels in her brother!

259
00:15:37,937 --> 00:15:40,856
Naturally, any biological brother is
considered a tool.

260
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,067
Human brother. Legal!

261
00:15:43,150 --> 00:15:44,068
- Legal!
- Legal!

262
00:15:46,528 --> 00:15:49,281
We are now existing
in a lawless hellscape!

263
00:15:49,365 --> 00:15:52,743
But maybe it would be more accurate
to call it a battle wonderland!

264
00:15:54,703 --> 00:15:56,538
Mr. Saotome. Oh.

265
00:15:57,539 --> 00:16:00,167
Now is not the time for us
to be sitting around and drinking tea.

266
00:16:02,002 --> 00:16:04,505
Well, you certainly are
a tenacious woman.

267
00:16:05,547 --> 00:16:07,132
For such a dogged match...

268
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:14,640
This would fell even a cockroach!
Boiling Water Attack!

269
00:16:16,141 --> 00:16:18,644
Saotome can't cope with the heat
and backs off.

270
00:16:18,727 --> 00:16:20,980
Perfectly reasonable
to want to avoid scalding water.

271
00:16:24,942 --> 00:16:26,860
You didn't seem to enjoy that very much.

272
00:16:26,944 --> 00:16:29,446
If I turn back into a guy
dressed like this...

273
00:16:29,530 --> 00:16:31,115
I'm not getting hit with that!

274
00:16:31,198 --> 00:16:34,410
Saotome has escaped into the air,
but Kuno won't let her get away.

275
00:16:34,493 --> 00:16:35,744
Nice try!

276
00:16:37,997 --> 00:16:39,748
UH-OH!

277
00:16:39,832 --> 00:16:41,375
What was that?

278
00:16:41,458 --> 00:16:44,795
Ranma Saotome has just taken
a direct hit of boiling water!

279
00:16:44,878 --> 00:16:46,463
Do you think it hurt?

280
00:16:46,547 --> 00:16:47,548
Hmm? What's that?

281
00:16:47,631 --> 00:16:50,759
There, in the steam... Are there two people?

282
00:16:50,843 --> 00:16:54,179
Nice outfit you got on, Ranma.

283
00:16:54,263 --> 00:16:57,599
It's better than being completely naked.
You dummy!

284
00:16:59,601 --> 00:17:00,811
What's this?

285
00:17:00,894 --> 00:17:03,856
It looks like Saotome's
second has busted out the fire hose.

286
00:17:05,315 --> 00:17:07,443
Oh, I guess it was
just the girl and the pig.

287
00:17:07,526 --> 00:17:09,486
Must have been
an optical illusion.

288
00:17:12,698 --> 00:17:14,992
- Oh, thank goodness.
- Whoa!

289
00:17:15,075 --> 00:17:16,118
Oh, no!

290
00:17:16,201 --> 00:17:17,995
At this rate, she might get pushed
out of the ring!

291
00:17:18,078 --> 00:17:20,706
Which, as we know, would mean
instant disqualification.

292
00:17:21,582 --> 00:17:24,043
Looks like it's all over for Saotome.

293
00:17:24,126 --> 00:17:29,548
No way! Saotome is trying
to swim back to the middle of the ring.

294
00:17:29,631 --> 00:17:32,051
This is tenacity that defies common sense.

295
00:17:32,134 --> 00:17:34,011
So she enlisted help from her second.

296
00:17:34,094 --> 00:17:35,763
How very sneaky.

297
00:17:37,347 --> 00:17:39,266
What the...

298
00:17:41,185 --> 00:17:43,312
Give up this pointless struggle.

299
00:17:43,395 --> 00:17:46,065
You wish to steal Lord Ranma
from me that badly?

300
00:17:46,148 --> 00:17:49,651
Excuse me?
When exactly did he agree to be yours?

301
00:17:49,735 --> 00:17:50,819
I refuse to argue.

302
00:17:50,903 --> 00:17:52,696
This is annoying.

303
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:54,948
Get out of the ring already!

304
00:17:55,032 --> 00:17:57,076
Whoa! No!

305
00:17:57,159 --> 00:18:00,037
This time it's Kodachi Kuno
who's flying out of the ring.

306
00:18:03,332 --> 00:18:04,416
Whoa!

307
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:05,542
Huh?

308
00:18:10,798 --> 00:18:13,717
Huh. Did the ring just move?

309
00:18:16,804 --> 00:18:19,264
You'll never be able to push me
out of this ring.

310
00:18:23,018 --> 00:18:24,436
I know your game.

311
00:18:25,979 --> 00:18:29,817
There we go. The ring was moved
using a group of people hidden beneath it.

312
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:32,319
Members of
the St. Bacchus' School for Girls'

313
00:18:32,402 --> 00:18:35,405
Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics Team
frantically leave the ring.

314
00:18:36,031 --> 00:18:38,408
And, uh,
now that the mat has been demolished,

315
00:18:38,492 --> 00:18:41,495
the only remaining footholds are
the corner posts and ropes.

316
00:18:41,578 --> 00:18:43,455
Falling off them would mean a loss.

317
00:18:43,539 --> 00:18:47,334
Good thing aerial combat is key to our
School of Anything Goes Martial Arts.

318
00:18:47,417 --> 00:18:49,253
Come on! Let's put an end to this!

319
00:18:49,336 --> 00:18:50,838
You're so impudent!

320
00:18:53,257 --> 00:18:54,550
Ryoga!

321
00:18:54,633 --> 00:18:55,634
Razor hoop!

322
00:19:07,229 --> 00:19:09,022
All right, you dunderhead.

323
00:19:09,106 --> 00:19:12,985
If you ever dare to get in my way again,
I will rip your little pig body to shreds.

324
00:19:13,068 --> 00:19:16,947
For some reason, Saotome has started
boorishly bullying the pig!

325
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:20,784
But that careless mistake allowed Kodachi
to catch Ranma off guard.

326
00:19:21,493 --> 00:19:24,788
Seems as though she'll land
right in the middle of the ring!

327
00:19:25,873 --> 00:19:28,167
No, she's not down-and-out yet.

328
00:19:28,250 --> 00:19:30,627
What stunning tenacity from Saotome.

329
00:19:30,711 --> 00:19:32,129
Okay, time for me to take you down!

330
00:19:39,428 --> 00:19:41,722
Uh-oh. She's swinging back
like a pendulum.

331
00:19:41,805 --> 00:19:43,765
Well that certainly is a shame, isn't it?

332
00:19:43,849 --> 00:19:44,892
Let's end this!

333
00:19:46,643 --> 00:19:49,021
She's using the recoil
from the rope to launch herself.

334
00:19:49,104 --> 00:19:50,898
But will she make it this time?

335
00:19:50,981 --> 00:19:53,233
You're such a fool.

336
00:19:54,151 --> 00:19:56,778
Did you forget you can't attack me
without a weapon?

337
00:19:59,615 --> 00:20:02,701
The only weapon I need is
the one you're standing on!

338
00:20:18,258 --> 00:20:22,137
Oh! Kodachi Kuno has fallen
outside of the ring!

339
00:20:22,221 --> 00:20:26,141
That's it. The winner is Ranma Saotome!

340
00:20:33,857 --> 00:20:35,776
Total defeat.

341
00:20:35,859 --> 00:20:37,236
Whoo! Ranma!

342
00:20:37,319 --> 00:20:41,281
Just as I promised you, I shall
throw the feelings I had to the side.

343
00:20:42,241 --> 00:20:44,076
All those burning feelings of desire.

344
00:20:48,121 --> 00:20:49,289
Kodachi.

345
00:20:51,375 --> 00:20:52,626
Oh.

346
00:20:58,131 --> 00:20:59,633
I've come to a decision.

347
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:01,969
At tomorrow's new dawn,

348
00:21:02,052 --> 00:21:05,472
I shall burn for Lord Ranma
with a new and unique fervor!

349
00:21:08,517 --> 00:21:11,144
Lord Ranma!

350
00:21:11,228 --> 00:21:15,023
We admire the persistence
of your fighting spirit, Kodachi Kuno!

351
00:21:15,107 --> 00:21:18,443
We'd want nothing less for our
blossoming black rose of the ring.

352
00:21:22,531 --> 00:21:24,283
She's all burned out.
